/**
 * A face for each connector, skill and plugin, so a list of them reads at a
 * glance instead of as a wall of names and paths.
 *
 * Whatever is behind a row wears its real single-colour logo: the service a
 * connector reaches (by its name, its address or the package it starts), the
 * vendor whose app installed it, or the runtime it runs on; a skill's own
 * brand or the CLI that owns it; a plugin's brand or its marketplace's. The
 * marks are from Simple Icons (CC0) unless noted, inline so the page never
 * waits on a third-party asset. Marks whose brand colour is near black use
 * the text colour so they show in both themes. Anything else gets its first
 * letter on a tint picked from its name, or a drawn glyph.
 */

